[Cheats/Enable Debug Menuyou will enter the debug menu when you first start up the game. At anytime, to go back to it, press and hold Select button while entering any mode, such as the Options menu. From the beginning	Starts the game.Scenario Sends you to a list of story related scenes to choose from. Character Allows you to view all of the character portraits.BG Allows you to view all of the background images.Event Allows you to view all of the event images in the game.BGM Doesn't work.SE Goes through all of the SFX in the game. Effect Doesn't work.Movie Allows you to watch all of the movies in the game. Route Check This appears to be the same as the Scenario option.System Flag Unlocks everything in the game when selected.] 
